## Prevent duplicate cache-refresh notifications

Context: A slow adjacency-refresh status request could outlive the 1.5-second
poll interval. Multiple overlapping requests then observed the same completed
task and each displayed an "Adjacency refreshed successfully" notification.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/js/query-databricks-build.js
   Replace the asynchronous interval with sequential polling that schedules the
   next request only after the current request completes.
2. tests/units/front/test_adjacency_refresh_ui.py
   Add a regression contract that rejects overlapping interval polling and
   requires sequential refresh polling.

